  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and celery and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the Thai red curry paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the shredded cabbage and cook until it starts to wilt.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and add the fish sauce, lime juice, salt, and pepper.",
    "Stir well and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the curry simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
